== [    BASIC ] ============================================================================================
   MNEMONIC: lgdt [ENC: DEFAULT, MAP: 0F, OPC: 0x01]
     LENGTH:  3
        SSZ: 32
       EOSZ: 32
       EASZ: 32
   CATEGORY: SYSTEM
    ISA-SET: I286REAL
    ISA-EXT: BASE
 EXCEPTIONS: NONE
 ATTRIBUTES: HAS_MODRM IS_PRIVILEGED ACCEPTS_SEGMENT 
  OPTIMIZED: 0F 01 10 

== [ OPERANDS ] ============================================================================================
##       TYPE  VISIBILITY  ACTION      ENCODING   SIZE  NELEM  ELEMSZ  ELEMTYPE                        VALUE
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------
 0     MEMORY    EXPLICIT       R      MODRM_RM     48      1      48    STRUCT  TYPE  =                 MEM
                                                                                 SEG   =                  ds
                                                                                 BASE  =                 eax
                                                                                 INDEX =                none
                                                                                 SCALE =                   0
                                                                                 DISP  =  0x0000000000000000
 1   REGISTER      HIDDEN       W          NONE      0      1       0       INT                         gdtr
--  ---------  ----------  ------  ------------   ----  -----  ------  --------  ---------------------------

== [      ATT ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: lgdt (%eax)
   RELATIVE: lgdt (%eax)

== [    INTEL ] ============================================================================================
   ABSOLUTE: lgdt fword ptr ds:[eax]
   RELATIVE: lgdt fword ptr ds:[eax]

== [ SEGMENTS ] ============================================================================================
0F 01 10 
:     :..MODRM
:..OPCODE
